{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35632","headline":"雨後过华岳庙 · 李山甫","name":"雨後过华岳庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华山黑影霄崔嵬，金天□□门未开。\n雨淋鬼火灭不灭，风送神香来不来。\n墙外素钱飘似雪，殿前阴栢吼如雷。\n知君暗宰人间事，休把苍生梦里裁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}